Terminals unused in grammar

    COMMENTLINE
    CMD_AC
    CMD_OPTION


Grammar

    0 $accept: spice $end

    1 spice: netlist end

    2 end: end EOL
    3    | END

    4 netlist: netlist line
    5        | line

    6 line: component EOL
    7     | command EOL
    8     | EOL
    9     | error EOL

   10 component: resistor
   11          | capacitor
   12          | inductor
   13          | vccs
   14          | vs
   15          | vcvs
   16          | cs
   17          | cccs
   18          | ccvs

   19 command: print
   20        | dc
   21        | op
   22        | plot

   23 resistor: RESISTOR node node value

   24 capacitor: CAPACITOR node node value

   25 inductor: INDUCTOR node node value

   26 vccs: VCCS node node node node value

   27 vs: VS node node
   28   | VS node node value
   29   | vs RK_DC value
   30   | vs RK_AC value

   31 vcvs: VCVS node node node node value

   32 cs: CS node node value

   33 cccs: CCCS node node VS value

   34 ccvs: CCVS node node VS value

   35 op: CMD_OP

   36 dc: CMD_DC
   37   | dc VS value value value

   38 print: CMD_PRINT RK_AC
   39      | CMD_PRINT RK_DC
   40      | CMD_PRINT RK_OP
   41      | CMD_PRINT RK_TRAN
   42      | print VAR_V
   43      | print VAR_I

   44 plot: CMD_PLOT RK_AC
   45     | CMD_PLOT RK_DC
   46     | CMD_PLOT RK_OP
   47     | CMD_PLOT RK_TRAN
   48     | plot VAR_V
   49     | plot VAR_I

   50 node: STRING
   51     | INTEGER
   52     | RESISTOR
   53     | CAPACITOR
   54     | INDUCTOR
   55     | VS
   56     | VCCS

   57 value: VALUE
   58      | FLOAT
   59      | INTEGER


